# Isolated payment-test DATABASE URLs (#18C-1)
# Copy to .env.payment-test.db.local (gitignored).
# Never commit this file with real URIs. Never paste URIs into chat.
#
# Where to get each value (Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → Database):
#   Connection string → URI
# Prefer Direct (db.<project-ref>.supabase.co:5432) or Session pooler.
# Do NOT use transaction pooler port 6543 for dump/restore.
# The value must be the FULL URI from the dashboard (includes project host).
# Short placeholders (not a real Dashboard URI) are rejected.
#
# LIVE_DB_URL = production project qifloweuwyhvukabgnoa (schema READ / dump only)
# PAYMENT_TEST_DB_URL = metalora-payment-test project (restore target)
#
# Password = database password, NOT the service_role JWT.
# Do not reset the production database password unless you intend that change.

LIVE_DB_URL=
PAYMENT_TEST_DB_URL=
